Server init.
>> a := Blob anyar: 4.
a bytes: ( Daptar anyar ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob anyar: 4.
b bytes: ( Daptar anyar ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a anyar.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Kaluaran tulis: ( a ^ c ), baris-anyar. } tangkep: { :e Kaluaran tulis: e, baris-anyar. }, jalankeun.
a bébaskeun.
b bébaskeun.
